<div class="hero" id="top">
  <p class="eyebrow">A visual account of our session</p>
  <h1>What we<br />actually did.</h1>
  <p class="lede">You gave me a documentation export. We turned its contradictory claims into two GitHub issues and a rendered review. This page explains the work, the components, and my choices without asking you to follow the fictional story.</p>
